ALGORITHM-LEVEL REIMPLEMENTATIONS (no source code copied)

- The Monte Carlo module follows the grmonty scheme (Dolence et al. 2009,
  ApJS 184, 387). Samplers in src/montecarlo/ are clean-room reimplementations
  of published algorithms also used by gpumonty/grmonty, which are distributed
  under the GPL; no GPL source was copied or consulted.

- The polarized-transfer stiffness diagnostic in src/gpu_pol.jl re-derives the
  transfer-matrix eigenvalue analysis used by RAPTOR (Bronzwaer et al. 2018,
  A&A 613, A2), which is distributed under the GPL; no GPL source was copied
  or consulted.


